6504        * Source: S154 / Chapter 96 / `MULTREG Statement` (PDF pp. 7763–7768); S154 / Chapter 96 / `ONECORR Statement` (PDF pp. 7768–7772); S154 /
6504     ! Chapter 96 / `ONESAMPLEFREQ Statement` (PDF pp. 7772–7780).
6505        * Discriminates: Example 96.5: Multiple Regression and Correlation; explicit statements: MULTREG, ONECORR
6506        */
6507       options nosyntaxcheck obs=max firstobs=1 nodate nonumber nocenter linesize=160 pagesize=max nostimer nofullstimer validvarname=v7
6507     ! validmemname=compatible locale=en_US;
6508       %let syscc=0;
6509       title; footnote;
6510       ods _all_ close;
6511       ods listing gpath="%sysfunc(pathname(work))";
6512       ods graphics off;
6513       proc datasets library=work kill nolist;
NOTE: Deleting WORK.EXEMPLARY (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.FITFULL (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.POWER (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.PRIMNC (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.STATSFULL (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.STATSRED (memtype=DATA).
6513     !                                         quit;


6514       ods path work.templat(update) sashelp.tmplmst(read);
6515       
6516       ods graphics on;
6517       proc power;
6518       multreg
6519       model = random
6520       nfullpredictors = 7
6521       ntestpredictors = 1
6522       partialcorr = 0.35
6523       ntotal = 100
6524       power = .;
6525       plot x=n min=50 max=150;
6526       run;

NOTE: Plotting computed Power on the y-axis, versus N Total on the x-axis with 21 points per curve between 50 and 150.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE POWER printed page 525.

6527       ods graphics off;
6528       proc power;
6529       onecorr dist=fisherz
6530       npvars = 6
6531       corr = 0.35
6532       nullcorr = 0.2
6533       sides = 1
6534       ntotal = 100
6535       power = .;
6536       run;

NOTE: The PROCEDURE POWER printed page 526.

